WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.267 --> 00:00:13.665
I want to park the car.

2
00:00:13.666 --> 00:00:19.389
There is a parking lot sign.

3
00:00:19.390 --> 00:00:21.408
I want to wash my hands.

4
00:00:21.409 --> 00:00:28.525
There is a bathroom sign.

5
00:00:28.526 --> 00:00:30.971
I want to go to the seventh floor.

6
00:00:30.972 --> 00:00:38.298
There is an elevator sign.

7
00:00:38.299 --> 00:00:40.618
I want to go outside.

8
00:00:40.619 --> 00:00:47.757
There is an exit sign.

9
00:00:47.758 --> 00:00:49.913
