10
00:00:49.914 --> 00:00:57.271
There is a telephone sign.

11
00:00:57.272 --> 00:00:59.070
I want to ride a bike.

12
00:00:59.071 --> 00:01:05.564
There is a bike path sign.

13
00:01:05.565 --> 00:01:07.770
